  "title": "Preconscious stimulus",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "1ae4f960-4aa3-4db9-9262-b2ede825d9e7",
      "text": "A preconscious stimulus is strong and long enough that it could be seen, but is not accessed, for example because attention is elsewhere: its information is potentially accessible yet not accessed.",
